// One line per opcode: OP(Name, "operand kinds of a, b, c"). R register, K constant, A atom (property name), I signed
// 16-bit immediate, J jump (b and c together are a signed 32-bit offset in instructions, from the next instruction),
// N a count or index, - unused. The enum, the names and the disassembler come from this file.
